												"name": "Paragraph",
												"type": "textarea",
												"html": "<p style=\"text-align:center;\">\n\t\t\t\tThe Salvation Army MS Gulf Coast is happy to assist you on cold and extreme weather nights.&nbsp; However, for your safety, the safety of your neighbor, and the comfort of everyone staying we ask that you govern yourself by these guidelines.&nbsp; Violation of these guidelines can result in denial of services.\n\t\t\t</p>",
